# GitHub Pages

- `dist/` via **GitHub Actions** (niet branch/docs).
- URL `https://<owner>.github.io/Reaction-game/` → Vite `base: '/Reaction-game/'`.
- Workflow `.github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml`: push `main` + `workflow_dispatch`.
- Perms: `contents: read`, `pages: write`, `id-token: write`. Concurrency tegen overlap.
- `npm ci` → `npm test` → typecheck → `npm run build` → artifact → deploy. Rood = geen deploy.
- Prefer hash/single-route; path-routes → `404.html` ≈ `index.html`.
- Na wijziging: `base`, asset-URLs, SW-scope checken.
